<title>USA: Eagle USA opens four new terminals.</title>
<headline>Eagle USA opens four new terminals.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eagle USA Airfreight Inc said it is opening four new domestic terminals.</p>
<p>The company said that effective immediately, customer service centers and terminal facilities in Boise, Idaho; Harrisburg, Pa.; Reno, Nev.; and South Bend, Ind., are completely operational.</p>
<p>Previously, Eagle USA maintained a presence in these markets by using local shipping agents.</p>
<p>With the addition of the four new terminals, Eagle now has terminals in 56 locations.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
